1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,725
Speaking, task three. Story number 21: At the post office. What did Mrs Petrová do yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,567 --> 00:00:13,524
What did Mrs Petrová do yesterday?

3
00:00:34,167 --> 00:00:37,367
Yesterday morning Mrs Petrová wanted to send a present to her grandson.

4
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:41,633
At home she first packed a toy and a book into a box and wrote the address.

5
00:00:41,833 --> 00:00:43,333
Then she went to the post office.

6
00:00:43,533 --> 00:00:46,833
There was a long queue at the post office, so she waited twenty minutes.

7
00:00:47,033 --> 00:00:50,600
The clerk weighed the parcel and said it cost six hundred crowns.

8
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,833
Mrs Petrová paid by card.

9
00:00:53,033 --> 00:00:56,000
A week later the parcel arrived and her grandson was very happy.

10
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:04,923
Tell story 21 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
